                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">From the Diario del Plata, Montevideo, September 18, 1913.</p>
                <p>Fortunately Pan-Americanism, American solidarity, an ideal of a higher
                    civilization, has commenced to make itself known through Mr. Wilson. In the
                    future the Latin-American nations, so often plundered and oppressed by arbitrary
                    tyrants, will know to whom they should appeal in their protests against
                    unconstitutional despotism.</p>
            </div>
